OL,3,GNEWSAPoliticians share frustration over
OL,4,Awater pollution
OL,5,
OL,6,FPoliticians and campaigners have shared
OL,7,Ftheir frustration at the pollution
OL,8,Fincidents that led to South West Water
OL,9,Fbeing fined nearly #8m for hundreds of
OL,10,Fsewage spills.
OL,12,FOn Tuesday at Plymouth Magistrates'
OL,13,FCourt the company was fined #7,867,733
OL,14,Fand ordered to pay #329,993 after
OL,15,Fadmitting a series of pollution-related
OL,16,Foffences over six years in Bodmin,
OL,17,FHarlyn, Playing Place, and Polperro in
OL,18,FCornwall, and Plymouth in Devon.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
