OL,3,GNEWSAPoliticians share frustration over
OL,4,Awater pollution
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt apologised for what happened and
OL,7,Fsaid it remained "focussed on the
OL,8,Ffuture" and that "significant
OL,9,Fimprovements" have been made across the
OL,10,Fsites.
OL,12,FLiberal Democrat MP for North Cornwall,
OL,13,FBen Maguire, said South West Water
OL,14,F(SWW) committed a "staggering catalogue
OL,15,Fof pollution.
